OL,4,CLara Croft's permanent homecoming      
OL,5,Cafter 30 years                         
OL,6,GA 9ft (2.7m) statue of Tomb Raider     
OL,7,Gstar Lara Croft has been permanently   
OL,8,Ginstalled in Derby, the birthplace of  
OL,9,Gthe franchise.                         
OL,11,FThe sculpture, which formed part of    
OL,12,Fthe Tomb Raider: The LIVE Experience   
OL,13,Fat Camden Market in London, had been   
OL,14,Fin storage since the attraction closed 
OL,15,Fin 2023, but moved to a temporary home 
OL,16,Fat the Museum of Making last month.    
OL,18,FThe statue was installed at Derby      
OL,19,FMarket Hall on Friday after a #30,000  
OL,20,Ffundraising campaign brought it to the 
OL,21,Fcity as a permanent tribute to Derby's 
OL,22,Frole in video game folklore.      G1/4 
