OL,4,CAI meme complaint upheld against       
OL,5,Cpolice boss                            
OL,6,GA complaint about an AI meme posted by 
OL,7,Ga police and crime commissioner on     
OL,8,Gsocial media has been upheld.          
OL,10,FRupert Matthews was referred to the    
OL,11,Fthe Independent Office for Police      
OL,12,FConduct relating to an allegation that 
OL,13,Fa meme shared on social media may have 
OL,14,Fbeen a racial hate crime.              
OL,16,FThe IOPC concluded there was "no       
OL,17,Findication" the Leicestershire Police  
OL,18,Fand Crime Commissioner had committed a 
OL,19,Fcriminal offence and returned the      
OL,20,Fmatter to a police and crime panel     
OL,21,Fcomplaints committee, which published  
OL,22,Fits findings on Friday.           G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
