OL,4,CTwo men charged with murder after      
OL,5,C'street assault'                       
OL,6,GTwo men have been charged with murder  
OL,7,Gafter a man died following an alleged  
OL,8,Gstreet assault in June.                
OL,10,FThames Valley Police said the charges  
OL,11,Fwere in connection with the death of   
OL,12,FNathan Jordan, 33, in Chesham,         
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire, on 10 June.           
OL,15,FThe men charged are Leighlan Johnson,  
OL,16,F19, and Shane Johnson, 47, both from   
OL,17,FNorthampton. They were arrested        
OL,18,Fearlier in the year and rearrested on  
OL,19,FThursday, the force said.              
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
